    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d41">

                <pb facs="0074" n="60" sameAs="frus:frus1948v05p1/pg60"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">867N.6363/11–2248: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Saudi Arabia</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Childs</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jidda</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-11-22T18:00:00+03:00">November 22,
                            1948—6 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>603. Aminco representatives informed by SAG Palestine bar to conclusion
                    concession agreement Saudi half Kuweit neutral zone to Aminco or any other
                    American company. Aminco representatives believe SAG may be using Palestine as
                    lever to obtain better terms. They are leaving to await developments.</p>
                <pb facs="0075" n="61" xml:id="pg61"/>
                <p>Sent Department 603, Department pass London 158, Dhahran 291, Cairo 119, Baghdad
                    50, Damascus 23, Beirut 34, Jerusalem 24.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Childs</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
